<title>USA: Gabelli group lifts Triad Systems stake.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group lifts Triad Systems stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said it raised its stake in Triad Systems Corp to 10.46 percent or 1,850,800 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought a net of 666,100 shares of Triad between October 11 and October 17 at prices ranging from $5.75 to $9.5028 a share.</p>
